<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">不知何时</text><text for="L2">那句无心的玩笑话</text><text for="L3">因冒失而惹得你生气了呢</text><text for="L4">可连「对不起」这句话我也没能道出</text><text for="L5">这颗心脏的声音嘈杂不休 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘈杂不休)</span></text><text for="L6">从何时起</text><text for="L7">我产生了不想再这样继续的想法</text><text for="L8">将精心堆积起的积木扔之一旁</text><text for="L9">在轻触那因心跳而颤动的指尖</text><text for="L10">导致积木崩塌之前 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(崩塌)</span></text><text for="L11">没错 这烦恼的根源</text><text for="L12">总是 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(总是)</span></text><text for="L13">和某人之事</text><text for="L14">和明日之事</text><text for="L15">和未来</text><text for="L16">都有所牵连</text><text for="L17">呐 越是思索就越发加快</text><text for="L18">那脉搏的节拍</text><text for="L19">若能更巧妙地</text><text for="L20">若能更漂亮地</text><text for="L21">铭刻心间的话</text><text for="L22">即使双腿发软</text><text for="L23">即使声音颤抖</text><text for="L24">也不再介怀</text><text for="L25">就将心抛之一旁</text><text for="L26">就算节拍不停加速</text><text for="L27">我也都还未准备好啊</text><text for="L28">向右并沿着右侧的方向</text><text for="L29">一步也不曾踏错</text><text for="L30">待其汇合后 却仅将我遗留于此</text><text for="L31">时光啊也逐步加速</text><text for="L32">曾经究竟是怎么走过来的呢</text><text for="L33">怎样的我 才算是我呢 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(才算是我呢)</span></text><text for="L34">啊啊……</text><text for="L35">我一直在眺望着远方</text><text for="L36">那总在远方的未来</text><text for="L37">也正逐步接近着我</text><text for="L38">一直一直</text><text for="L39">啊啊啊……</text><text for="L40">真正重要的事物 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(真正的)</span></text><text for="L41">总是 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(（谁也）)</span></text><text for="L42">不曾告诉过我 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(谁也)</span></text><text for="L43">从此以后的事情</text><text for="L44">珍重的事物 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(珍重的事物)</span></text><text for="L45">如今已经思考太多遍</text><text for="L46">让我愈发困惑</text><text for="L47">可我若能更为帅气地</text><text for="L48">可我若能昂首挺胸</text><text for="L49">向前迈进的话</text><text for="L50">即使双腿发软</text><text for="L51">即使声音颤抖</text><text for="L52">也不再介怀</text><text for="L53">就将心抛之一旁</text><text for="L54">就算节拍不停加速</text><text for="L55">让我感到胸间撕裂般痛苦</text><text for="L56">咽于喉间的「对不起」 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊啊啊……)</span></text><text for="L57">为此颤动的指尖 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊啊啊……)</span></text><text for="L58">回想起来 我的内心深处 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊啊啊……内心深处)</span></text><text for="L59">总是感到痛楚的跳动都是 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊啊啊……)</span></text><text for="L60">在触碰到无可代替之物时</text><text for="L61">还有本该去爱之物时</text><text for="L62">那些瞬间</text><text for="L63">感受到的</text><text for="L64">一定</text><text for="L65">那颗跳动的心脏</text><text for="L66">所鸣响出的鼓动</text><text for="L67">就是一直都在告诉我</text><text for="L68">哪些是对我来说重要的事物</text><text for="L69">无论何时</text><text for="L70">无论是被谁贴上的</text><text for="L71">所谓「个性」标签都是无需之物</text><text for="L72">无论到哪</text><text for="L73">响彻吧我的心音 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啊啊啊……心跳声)</span></text><text for="L74">那是不属于他人</text><text for="L75">而是我的证明</text><text for="L76">就让它自豪地鸣响吧</text><text for="L77">让那颗快要撕裂的</text><text for="L78">心脏去响彻世间</text><text for="L79">毕竟那是世界上唯一的证明</text><text for="L80">我一直在眺望着远方</text><text for="L81">那总在远方的未来</text><text for="L82">也正逐步接近着我</text><text for="L83">一直一直</text><text for="L84">很久以前的我</text><text for="L85">一直在寻找的事物</text><text for="L86">其实一直在我身旁</text><text for="L87">一直一直</text><text for="L88">这是开始的信号 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(开始的信号)</span></text></translation><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="und-Latn"><text for="L1">i tsu ka</text><text for="L2">ko ko ro ni mo na i ka ru ku chi de</text><text for="L3">mi da ri ni ki mi wo o ko ra se te shi ma tta ne</text><text for="L4">「go me n ne」sa e i i da se na ka tta</text><text for="L5">ko no shi n zo u no o to ga u ru sa ku te <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(u ru sa ku te)</span></text><text for="L6">i tsu da kke</text><text for="L7">ko re i jo u wa to me ni shi yo u to</text><text for="L8">ku mi a ge te ki ta tsu mi ki wo te ba na shi ta</text><text for="L9">ko do u ni yu re ta yu bi sa ki ni fu re te</text><text for="L10">ku zu re te shi ma u ma e ni to</text><text for="L11">so u na ya mi no ta ne wa</text><text for="L12">i tsu mo <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(i tsu mo)</span></text><text for="L13">da re ka no ko to to</text><text for="L14">a shi ta no ko to to</text><text for="L15">mi ra i no ko to</text><text for="L16">ba ka ri da</text><text for="L17">ne e ka n ga e ru ho do ka ke a shi de</text><text for="L18">mya ku u tsu ri zu mu</text><text for="L19">mo tto jo u zu ni</text><text for="L20">mo tto ki re i ni</text><text for="L21">ki za me ta ra</text><text for="L22">a shi ga su ku n de shi ma tte mo</text><text for="L23">ko e ga fu ru e te mo</text><text for="L24">o ka ma i na shi</text><text for="L25">ko ko ro wa o ki za ri no ma ma de</text><text for="L26">ka so ku shi te i ku bii to</text><text for="L27">ma da ju n bi mo de ki te i na i no ni</text><text for="L28">mi gi mu ke mi gi no to o ri ni</text><text for="L29">ha mi da sa na i yo u ni</text><text for="L30">so ro e ra re ta bo ku wo to ri no ko shi ta ma ma de</text><text for="L31">ka so ku su ru hi bi yo</text><text for="L32">do n na ka ze ni a ru i te i ta kke</text><text for="L33">do n na bo ku ga bo ku da tta kke</text><text for="L35">zu tto to o ku ni mi te i ta</text><text for="L36">zu tto sa ki no mi ra i wa</text><text for="L37">zu tto chi ka ku ni ki te i ta</text><text for="L38">zu tto zu tto</text><text for="L40">ho n to u ni da i ji na ko to wa</text><text for="L41">i tsu mo <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(da re mo)</span></text><text for="L42">o shi e te ku re na i <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(da re mo)</span></text><text for="L43">ko re ka ra no ko to</text><text for="L44">ka n ji n na to ko <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(ka n ji n na to ko)</span></text><text for="L45">i ma mo ka n ga e re ba ka n ga e ru ho do</text><text for="L46">wa ka ra na ku te</text><text for="L47">mo tto ka kko u yo ku</text><text for="L48">mo tto mu ne ha tte</text><text for="L49">su su me ta ra</text><text for="L50">a shi ga su ku n de shi ma tte mo</text><text for="L51">ko e ga fu ru e te mo</text><text for="L52">o ka ma i na shi</text><text for="L53">ko ko ro wa o ki za ri no ma ma de</text><text for="L54">ka so ku shi te i ku bii to</text><text for="L55">ha ri sa ke te shi ma i so u da</text><text for="L56">no do ni tsu ka e ta「go me n ne」</text><text for="L57">yu re u go ku yu bi sa ki</text><text for="L58">i tsu mo o mo e ba ko no mu ne no o ku ga</text><text for="L59">i ta i ho do mya ku u tsu no wa</text><text for="L60">ka ke ga e na i mo no ni</text><text for="L61">a i su ru be ki mo no ni</text><text for="L62">fu re ta shu n ka n</text><text for="L63">ba ka ri da</text><text for="L64">ki tto</text><text for="L65">to bi ha ne ru shi n zo u ga</text><text for="L66">na ra shi ta o to wa</text><text for="L67">bo ku ni to tte ho n to u ni ta i se tsu na mo no wo</text><text for="L68">o shi e te ku re te i ta n da zu tto</text><text for="L69">i tsu da tte</text><text for="L70">da re ka ni ha ra re ta</text><text for="L71">「ra shi sa」wa i ra na i</text><text for="L72">do ko ma de mo</text><text for="L73">hi bi ke bo ku no haa to bii to</text><text for="L74">da re de mo na i</text><text for="L75">ji bu n no a ka shi</text><text for="L76">ho ko ra shi ku na ra se</text><text for="L77">ha ri sa ke so u na</text><text for="L78">ko ko ro de na ra se</text><text for="L79">se ka i de hi to tsu no a ka shi</text><text for="L80">zu tto to o ku ni mi te i ta</text><text for="L81">zu tto sa ki no mi ra i wa</text><text for="L82">zu tto chi ka ku ni ki te i ru</text><text for="L83">zu tto zu tto</text><text for="L84">zu tto ma e ka ra bo ku ga</text><text for="L85">zu tto sa ga shi te i ta mo no wa</text><text for="L86">zu tto chi ka ku ni a tta n da</text><text for="L87">zu tto zu tto</text><text for="L88">ko re wa ha ji ma ri no a i zu da <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(ha ji ma ri no a i zu da)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="50747104"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Xionghaizi001"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2108833053"/><amll:meta key="album" value="HEART BEAT"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="HEART BEAT"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YOASOBI"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721295079"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:18.479" end="5:31.647"><p begin="0:18.479" end="0:19.012" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.479" end="0:18.632">い</span><span begin="0:18.632" end="0:18.767">つ</span><span begin="0:18.767" end="0:19.012">か</span></p><p begin="0:19.012" end="0:22.417" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.012" end="0:19.940">心</span><span begin="0:19.940" end="0:20.242">に</span><span begin="0:20.242" end="0:20.548">も</span><span begin="0:20.548" end="0:20.828">無</span><span begin="0:20.828" end="0:21.147">い</span><span begin="0:21.147" end="0:21.596">軽</span><span begin="0:21.596" end="0:22.098">口</span><span begin="0:22.098" end="0:22.417">で</span></p><p begin="0:22.705" end="0:28.031" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.705" end="0:23.041">み</span><span begin="0:23.041" end="0:23.322">だ</span><span begin="0:23.322" end="0:23.655">り</span><span begin="0:23.655" end="0:23.936">に</span><span begin="0:23.936" end="0:24.559">君</span><span begin="0:24.559" end="0:24.972">を</span><span begin="0:25.186" end="0:25.768">怒</span><span begin="0:25.768" end="0:26.115">ら</span><span begin="0:26.115" end="0:26.432">せ</span><span begin="0:26.432" end="0:26.731">て</span><span begin="0:26.731" end="0:27.051">し</span><span begin="0:27.051" end="0:27.297">ま</span><span begin="0:27.297" end="0:27.583">っ</span><span begin="0:27.583" end="0:27.700">た</span><span begin="0:27.700" end="0:28.031">ね</span></p><p begin="0:28.321" end="0:32.261" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.321" end="0:28.612">「ご</span><span begin="0:28.612" end="0:28.890">め</span><span begin="0:28.890" end="0:29.188">ん</span><span begin="0:29.188" end="0:29.493">ね」</span><span begin="0:29.493" end="0:29.804">さ</span><s